cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EASE-Delta, please cite it as below."
title: "EASE-Delta: revision-aware decision computation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-02
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jithinsaireddy/ease-delta"
authors:
  - family-names: "Pothireddy"
    given-names: "Jithin"
abstract: >-
  Keeps a task's decisions current as its evidence is added, corrected or withdrawn. A
  fine-tuned encoder reads each (requirement, record) pair once; exact code handles versions,
  precedence, logic and planning, so a change re-reads only what it touches. Results, including
  hypotheses that were not supported, are in docs/RESULTS.md.
